Valam Guitar Chords with a strumming pattern sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Made In China.

Strumming Pattern: D DUDUDU

{c: Intro} [Dm] [G] [F] [Dm]

Mere preet laavjo mhari [C]haath valida
Pan [A#]velera tam aavjo maara [Gm]valam valida
Tam [Dm]laal no dariyo hove [C]tarsa valida,        Ki [Gm]velera tam aavjo… [Am]o o o

Hoo [Dm]tere piya itna [G]haseen,        Kaise [F]mujhse ye puche aay [Dm]na
Mera hi hai kya ye [G]naseeb,        [F]Ab bhi?yakeen?aaye [Dm] na

Mai teri?nazar uttaru,        Tujhe [F] jag se sambhalu
Koi [G] aanch?tujhpe aaye [C]na,        Tujhe [Dm] jitna mai pyaar karu [C]yara
Kisi aur se naa [A#]kiya (kiya kiya) [Gm]o oo o,        Tujhe [F]tootke maine nhi [C]chaha
To pyaar hi kya [Gm]kiya,        Ho..o..[Dm]o..o..o..[Em]o

[Dm]Mere preet laavjo mhari [C]haath valida,        Pan [Gm]velera tam aavjo… [Am]o o [Dm]o

Ho..resham ke dhhage [Gm]pedon pe bandhe,        [F]Maine kahan the ka [Dm]bhi
Par aasmaan me [G] apne sitare,        [F]Jud hi gye phir [Dm]bhi

Mai teri nazar uttaru,        Tujhe [F]jag se sambhalu
Koi [G] aanch tujhpe aaye [C]na,        Tujhe [Dm]jitna mai pyaar karu [C]yara
Kisi aur se naa [A#]kiya (kiya kiya),        [Gm]Ho oo..o.o
Tujhe [F]tootke maine nhi [C]chaha,        To pyaar hi kya [Gm]kiya ho..o..[Am]o

